{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "38494953cc925ae54e69a5913ca05e8379cb930d81507023cbe60e197ad1dfc1", "ja": "意外だけど、ぴったりな組み合わせ……。\nあっ、チョコが冷蔵庫に残ってたよね。あとは……。", "zh": "意外却很合适的组合……  \n啊，对了，冰箱里还剩着巧克力吧。接下来是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "2145046eaea9edf97719bc5eefbbed7074068bdc81ec3228c2af220e94e23b55", "ja": "あとは、う～ん……。意外性って、自分ひとりで\n考えると結構思いつかないかも……。", "zh": "剩下的嘛，嗯……意外性这种东西，光靠自己一个人想的话，可能还真不太容易想到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1002_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "2acab074ed73ebe51a3f19f706c6d8ed00ced2221a3467baaa907a77730c94c8", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。\n劇場の冷蔵庫って、まだ空きありますか？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n剧场的冰箱还有空位吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "b13dff7b2a72d27669513e82414bb23abbc900f0f27285e3b34eb000d2aed1e4", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\n空きはありますけど……その手に持っている物は？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n位置是还有啦……不过您手上拿的是什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "2134f647c31f831dbc178bddc65775ea3f998c156cdec81ca14d46fe2163350b", "ja": "はっ！\nもしかしたら、意外なものの予感……！", "zh": "啊！\n难道是感觉会出现什么意外的东西……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c47c80c745bea42d246284e20152e6fabec1304f2decddc476fcadd9c18b3ad0", "ja": "意外？　取引先からいただいたんです。\nししゃもだから、冷蔵庫に入れたいなと。", "zh": "意外？这是合作方送的。\n因为是柳叶鱼，我想放进冰箱里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "90443edc94730cdac3463b76e18d0e213dd758ebd6c52ca9a7ccbef890c914d9", "ja": "ししゃも！　……チョコと、ししゃも……\n甘いとしょっぱいだけど、でも、さすがに……？", "zh": "柳叶鱼！……巧克力和柳叶鱼……一个甜，一个咸，可是，这未免也……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "0325604f9c07757ea4b87c7d14b1f07ee94a367b2ee363490c38541a8feb3c51", "ja": "ううん、何事もチャレンジ……！\n{$P$}さん、確かに受け取りました！", "zh": "不，凡事都要挑战……！\n{$P$}先生，我确实收到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9399ae611a8176ae101e1aa23a886db01a3b7bcb252fe017728406114e1f934c", "ja": "は、はい。それでは保存の方、\nよろしくお願いします。", "zh": "好、好的。那么保存的事，\n就拜托您了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "6b0b1ffa157b0cd1f91cb6ff8331df48a7fdc5871c6c5976c1bcb70b1d091eb6", "ja": "それと、社長さんがお呼びでしたよ。なんでも、\n先日の企画書についてのお話だとか！", "zh": "另外，社长先生刚才叫您过去。听说是要谈谈前几天企划书的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f7b48f1e3a25cb34c284e258ac742b05c883d736bf2b293322cb29f9bbe7b6d8", "ja": "企画書……あっ、デュオの件かな？\nありがとうございます、行ってきます！", "zh": "企划书……啊，是关于双人组合的事吗？\n谢谢，我这就过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "400c4e1a4191b518eb83dfebc7cedb5423fa7cdc21b618188678f2d4353d1911", "ja": "はい、いってらっしゃーい♪\nまずはチョコを湯煎する準備をしなくっちゃ！", "zh": "好，路上小心——♪\n首先得准备隔水加热巧克力才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1013_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "721761eae3654cababdfc3ada7e0cbdbbd78eba53eccc08b738abba988ff6d92", "ja": "お疲れさまです社長、音無さん！", "zh": "社长、音无小姐，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "13b4444647e06825365c6e62f48b4529eb468a349e668b46d4140aec493b2e79", "ja": "やあ君、よく来たね！\n早速だが、先日君が提案した企画……。", "zh": "呀，你来啦！\n事不宜迟，你前几天提议的那个企划……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "7069757040cab4b3e09b2a24fc8615a0cf5bf1c68685bb7a3d2bd2df6de6406a", "ja": "このタイミングで、進めようと思う！\n桜守歌織君と、白石紬君によるデュオだ。", "zh": "我想就在这个时候推进下去！\n这是由樱守歌织和白石紬组成的双人组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "abf4f2637a48e08dc73e7c8bbb6877e948f8937f36e2f821b2d13efbd643410d", "ja": "歌織さんと紬ちゃん、ということは……\nへびつかい座ですね！", "zh": "歌织小姐和小紬，也就是说……是蛇夫座！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d57ba86c0b79f34e2b611ab9043690b79aa23dde12a83806530844726e5eea44", "ja": "はい。あのふたりの天体公演を、\n開催しようと思います！", "zh": "是的。我打算举办那两位的星座公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "9f3e3cf1520b3928455665c061fe9a733b3d64206eb34117aff85101527df2d9", "ja": "それと、既にいくつかの企画から、\nコラボや出演の打診が届いていてね。", "zh": "此外，已经有好几个企划发来了\n联动或出演的邀约。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "2d062664651ccda395943a6167332c0e4603d86c4c5e367057e099e0878aaedd", "ja": "えっ、ずいぶん早い打診ですね……。\nまさか、社長が？", "zh": "咦，这么快就收到邀约了啊……难道是社长？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "363760c9626f14ce71d7e51d4944fdb6a08c14a20e665cd5a45ab4253fed3b8c", "ja": "こういう売り込みも社長の仕事のうちだからね。まあ、\n反響が大きく想像以上の量となってしまったが……。", "zh": "这种推销也是社长的工作之一嘛。说起来，\n反响太大，结果数量超出了预想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "e446fe2d16b938d17f539315ea35f43022429953ed0dc9a0a8b7930898e1dd6b", "ja": "社長～？　調子に乗って、変なところにまで\n売り込んだりしてませんよね……？", "zh": "社长～？　您没有得意忘形，跑去什么奇怪的地方\n乱揽活儿吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "bb51f71296f64ce0ab96decbe5111378229f2ee073f24142df80988ad5d2322f", "ja": "い、いや！　これも期待の表れということだよ！\nともかく、どの仕事を受けるかは君に一任しよう！", "zh": "不、不是！这也说明大家对你们充满期待嘛！\n总之，要接下哪份工作就全权交给你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "4d904ab17ca4c6696322d6aa65a15b7e8e691c97906e319f66873dc727eb1280", "ja": "オフィウクスの輝き……。\nとっておきの、きらめきを期待しているよ！", "zh": "蛇夫座的光辉……。\n期待着你那份珍藏的璀璨光芒哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1025_101kot", "source_sha256": "c7d732f09ebe499495eac17074686de598e69d7d7495e358f10063a0e169efe2", "ja": "もう。{$P$}さん、\n変な仕事だったら断っちゃってくださいね！", "zh": "真是的。{$P$}先生，\n要是奇怪的工作，请一定要推掉哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "7faca5126464e0fffa487c8a7667ddc7234d89517957b2246a73f5494cbbe4ec", "ja": "はい。でも社長の事ですから、\nアイドルを一番に考えてくださっていると信じてます！", "zh": "是的。不过，毕竟是社长，我相信他一直都把偶像放在第一位！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "a2b9ded8aaaa9d24314ecca2c82b1b6fd94a229d6af753682ad6247e4dc61722", "ja": "き、君……！", "zh": "你、你……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "fd610bcb6494cddacb9cf6240e335a58ac5315eb10101147f7528243ee5a7f73", "ja": "{$P$}さんたら、社長に\n甘いんだから。でも、そんなところも……ウフフ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你对社长也太纵容了。不过，那样的一面也……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "62fabd9a911614121ffbde99869b957952219e0bc48208b64705e262c4324f81", "ja": "音無さん？", "zh": "音无小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1030_101kot", "source_sha256": "7654edabf5cb4150cbc5a1fbc8867fe3d0a89f869df1eb87e4e8f288fe560ec0", "ja": "いえっ、なんでもありません！　歌織さんと紬ちゃん、\nどんなデュオになるか、楽しみですね♪", "zh": "没、没什么！歌织小姐和小紬，\n不知道会成为怎样的双人组合，真让人期待呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_intro_1031_p", "source_sha256": "ed8f642cd7f60889c984c459c102f56c6c0bdd530de0d76f9b89817a84300971", "ja": "はい！　ふたりのデュオ、\n全力でプロデュースしたいと思います！", "zh": "没错！我想全力制作这两人的双人组合！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
